---
.title = "Pass the Io Context Through an Application",
.date = "2026-09-29",
.author = "ZigCC",
.layout = "section.shtml",
---

Zig 0.16 makes `std.Io` an explicit dependency of code that performs I/O. The juicy
`std.process.Init` entry point provides the `io` implementation, allocator, arguments, and
environment map. Pass `init.io` to file, terminal, clock, and network operations instead of
using hidden global state.

